Phase 1 complete, empty repo to a clean, buildable full-stack
croquis. Established project-wide engineering law in CONVENTIONS.md: trust
boundary, server-side-only secrets, RLS on every table, prompt-injection
defence, single LLM abstraction, and the AI task registry. Frontend: Next.js
14 App Router + TS + Tailwind/shadcn, NextAuth v5 (GitHub/Google) via the
Supabase adapter, session middleware, and session-guarded, Zod-validated
/api/profile handlers — builds with zero TS errors. Backend: FastAPI AI
